            parts = listOf(
                StoryPart(1, "A Box of Cards", listOf(
                    "A box of unused postcards sat on the library's community table. The librarian explained that they had been donated for a project that never began. Each card showed a local landmark, but the captions were incomplete. When Chika joined the reading club, she suggested using them for a postcard exchange between schools.",
                    "The librarian agreed to supervise a small pilot. The students would need to verify every caption, obtain permission before sharing school contact details, and use an approved delivery address. Chika and her friend Femi began by listing the landmarks shown on the cards."
