                StoryPart(3, "A Partner School", listOf(
                    "The librarian contacted a partner school through the official school network. Its teacher agreed to exchange postcards about public landmarks and community spaces. Both schools would use their official postal addresses, and teachers would check the cards before they were sent.",
                    "Chika's class prepared a short introduction explaining the project and its rules. Students could sign their first names only if their school approved, or contribute as a class. Nobody needed to share home addresses, phone numbers, or private information."
