                StoryPart(4, "The First Message", listOf(
                    "Chika chose a postcard showing the public library. She wrote about its reading room and included the year it opened, after checking the date in the archive. Her teacher reviewed the text and corrected one detail about the building's earlier use.",
                    "The partner school replied with a card showing a public bridge. Its students described how the bridge connected two parts of their town and included a link to a council history page. Chika liked that the card contained both a personal observation and a source that readers could check."
